			"date": "2025-08-24T16:05:06.000Z",
			"content": "<p>A good pun is best served cold.</p><p>Just learned about Tool and Die manufacturing from this podcast: <a href=\"https://www.searchengine.show/the-puzzle-of-the-all-american-bbq-scrubber/\"><span>https://www.</span><span>searchengine.show/the-puzzle-o</span><span>f-the-all-american-bbq-scrubber/</span></a></p><p>Then I realized that Tool Or Die, a talk <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> gave over a decade ago about his dev workflow, was a play on it. <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/tool-or-die/\"><span>https://www.</span><span>zachleat.com/web/tool-or-die/</span><span></span></a></p><p>Slow clap.</p>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/tool-or-die/\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.searchengine.show/the-puzzle-of-the-all-american-bbq-scrubber/\">The Puzzle of the All-American BBQ Scrubber</a>",
